# Image tag, pinned. Never `latest`: this is the one line that answers "what is
# running?" and the one line a rollback edits. Published by the brittico-site
# repository's GitHub Action, tagged from its package.json.
SITE_VERSION=1.0.0

# The Godot export of the island — index.wasm, index.pck and friends. Not in
# the image and not in git; copied here by hand after each export.
ILHA_GAME_HOST_PATH=/path/to/brittico/ilha-game
